      "news_register_live_audio_source",
      "news_schedule_live_audio_ingest",
      "news_list_sources",
      "news_get_article"
    ],
    "category": "media",
    "description": "news.gftd.ai — primary-source collection (A layer): ingests RSS / government / live audio / on-chain / datasets / original reporting with provenance into the kotoba Datomic source corpus. The A→B medium is media.gftd.ai (ADR-2606161200).",
    "displayName": "News (news.gftd.ai) — primary sources",
